<h1>About</h1>
<p>Welcome to the Connections Manager application. This platform allows users to manage their connections, notes and simple reminders to stay connected and aware of their relationships. Designed by a team of dedicated student-developers, it aims to simplify relationship management and enhance personal connections.</p>
